OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Fisherman captures dolphins
OL,4,Achasing boat
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The fact that they come to check you
OL,7,Fout is always humbling," says a
OL,8,Ffisherman who was followed by a pod of
OL,9,Fdolphins.
OL,11,FEd Blake, a fisherman and Isle of Wight
OL,12,Fcouncillor, said he filmed the group of
OL,13,Fabout 20 dolphins, which included three
OL,14,Fcalves, on Monday after they started
OL,15,Fswimming alongside his boat between St
OL,16,FCatherine's Point and Ventnor.
OL,18,FDolphins are frequent visitors to the
OL,19,Fwaters around the island but Ed said
OL,20,Fthis was the first time he had seen the
OL,21,Fbottlenoses since the previous summer.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
