OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Fisherman captures dolphins
OL,4,Achasing boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said it was "always very special" to
OL,7,Fsee the animals interacting because it
OL,8,Fshowed the trust they had in humans.
